        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Springlatch for PDQ SF Series Light Commercial Levers</b>\r\n<p>For use with <a href=\"/products/orlando-standard-duty-cylindrical-lock-pdq-sf-orl\"><b>PDQ SF Series Commercial Door Levers</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/orlando-standard-duty-black-levers-pdq-sf-orl-622\"><b>PDQ SF Series Black Door Levers</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/light-duty-brushed-chrome-commercial-leversets-global-glc-series\"><b>Global GLC Series Levers</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/contemporary-light-duty-commercial-leversets\"><b>Deltana Light Commercial Door Levers</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSpringlatches are used on <b>Non-Keyed Functions</b> (does NOT uses a key to unlock the door knob/lever) including Passage and Privacy functions. Adjustable for both 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: For keyed functions use  <a href=\"/products/pdq-sv-and-sd-series-deadlatch\"><b>PDQ Deadlatch</b></a>.\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\nRadius corner face plate for wood doors. Includes <a href=\"/products/1-20-latch-spacer-plate-don-jo-lsp-1\">Latch Spacer Plate</a> for hollow metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually.\r\n</p>",
